  "body": "Append three late monitor discoveries to the November 20 dated review, actually reviewed November 23. SIR-Agent and RemoteEvolver are included after independent source-bound verification of persistent skill/tool updates; PhyRSI is excluded because the changing object is an external scientific inference algorithm. All previous review rows remain unchanged.\n\nOfficial v1 identity, source dates, quotations and independent reports are merged in #170. No HF recommendation date is inferred. The summaries retain SIR-Agent’s unresolved scenario-count mapping and RemoteEvolver’s negative-transfer limitation; no unsupported experimental number is published. No paid model request or experimental replication.\n\nValidation: exact source/date hashes, unchanged prior decisions and local dated-review validation passed. This approval must merge with successful exact-head owner-decision, build and test checks before applying only these three IDs.\n",
